{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:51:19.870Z","data":{"text":"All done. Both the task's verify and the proposal's `pnpm verify` pass (exit 0, 3826 + 152 tests green, lint clean).\n\n## What I changed\n\n**`src/core/spec/stack-dependencies.ts`** — `AwaitedDependency` gains optional `overlap: readonly string[]` (absent for declared lines). `awaitedDependencies` returns `depends_on` entries first, then the `.run/stacked-on` overlap lines no entry names whose change still reads `approved`/`archived` with the recorded hash. `formatStackedOn` writes `<folder> <hash>` vs `<folder> <hash> overlap <caps>`, and `parseStackedOn` reads both; a parsed declared line still deep-equals `{ folder, hash }`. File stayed at 247 lines.\n\n**`src/core/spec/stack-overlap.ts`** (new) — `overlappingChanges` returns other change folders `listChanges` finds in any tree, counted once by name, in `approved`/`archived` state with a shared capability, sorted by folder; `awaitedForApproval` prepends `awaitedDependencies` and drops overlaps another returned entry awaits transitively (following each folder where `listChanges` found it), so an overlap of a chain stacks on its tip; `overlapEntries` shapes the result field.\n\n**`src/core/spec/approve-worktree.ts`** — calls `awaitedForApproval`, spreads `overlapEntries` into the stacked result (245 lines).\n\n**`src/core/spec/approve.ts`** — `ApproveResult.overlaps?: { folder; capabilities }[]`.\n\n**`src/cli/approve.ts`** — prints `  Runs after <folder>, which also writes <caps>` per overlap between `  Waiting for:` and `  Stacked:`.\n\n**`tests/approve-overlap.test.ts`** (new) — 17 tests covering every row of \"Which changes overlap\" (including the chain-tip row), both \"Awaited dependencies\" scenarios (5 state rows + the line round-trip), and the two approve scenarios with the exact printed lines via the command's writers, the stacked copy's `.run/stacked-on`, and `result.overlaps`.\n\nAll new/changed exports carry `@scenario spec-lint-and-approve: <scenario>` and `@adr 003` tags. Result file written to `openspec/changes/170-approve-waits-for-overlap/.run/results/2.md`."}}
